    ✔ Phone number rule → 9–10 digits starting with 0, landlines too (Jui 11-8-26); dashes / spaces stripped before the check @done(26-11-08)
    ✔ Strawberry Nutella Bites ฿129 added to the menu (Jui 11-8-26, forgotten in the design): own section "bites" after Classic (menu order Hug → Classic → Bites → toppings), one variant "Regular", separate cup allowed → it opens a choice screen like Classic's without the size step. The design files have neither the section nor that screen — tell Jui when building them @done(26-11-08)
